      "text": "All eyes on Carolina. Panthers currently lead 35-33 with less than 2 minutes remaining. If they win, they’ll improve to 5-5, two games ahead of the 3-7 Bucs. If Panthers can finish this off, a Buccaneers loss to Carolina next week will be the nail in the coffin.",
