      "text": "That will do it in Detroit. The Lions defeat the Bucs, 31-21, to improve to 8-2 on the season. Tampa Bay, meanwhile, falls to 3-7. Overall, just not good enough offensively. Defensively, no takeaways and everything crashed back down to Earth. The Jacob Parrish injury was quite",
